    "updated_at": "2023-04-11T21:23:15Z",
    "body": "The text seems to imply that the directionality is only ever used when rendering the attribute content. Is it not true? And I believe any attribute can be \"rendered\", e.g with CSS `content: attr(type)`,  so this definition indeed needs to handle them too.",
